      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey prof, i'm kinda stuck on the fourier transform. i get the formula a little bit but i don't really get the actual \"vibe\" of what's happening. like, how does a signal actually turn into frequencies? can u explain the intuition behind it?",
      "source": "evaluator"
